# Playwright MCP scratch (screenshots, snapshots)
.playwright-mcp/

# THE PLAYER'S OWN SCREEN. `__lab-bg.webp` is a 1680x1050 capture of their real
# Upgrades screen - their credits, their ducats, their actual mod collection -
# and composite.html carries figures read off it. composite.html's own comment
# says the capture "must never reach a build".
#
# These two lines were REMOVED and both files were committed. There is no
# remote, so nothing escaped, and the blob has been taken back out of the single
# baseline commit rather than left in history where only a rewrite could reach
# it. They are dev instruments and they live on disk, untracked, on purpose.
__lab-bg.webp
composite.html

# Screenshots taken while looking at the overlay. The artboard and its
# backdrop are already ignored above; these are the pictures of them.
*.png
